  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can weave fey magic into a song or dance to fill others with vigor. As a Bonus Action, you can expend a use of Bardic Inspiration and roll a Bardic Inspiration die. Choose a number of other creatures within 60 feet of you up to your Charisma modifier (minimum of one): each gains Temporary Hit Points equal to twice the number rolled, and then each can use its Reaction to move up to its Speed without provoking Opportunity Attacks.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-wQRK8YscVj9DUaMs\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Roll once for all the creatures: the dialog rolls one formula for the whole card.</p></section>",
